      <h1 class="ed-title">How Much Does a Commercial Treadmill Cost?</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        A new full-commercial gym treadmill listed at roughly $9,000 to $14,000 at US dealers in November 2026, and a remanufactured one from about $2,500 to $4,000. Here is what each brand charges, where the light-commercial and used prices fall, and what delivery, service and leasing add.
