        <p class="ed-lead">
          Commercial treadmills are the machines built for gyms, hotels, clinics and apartment fitness
          rooms, where one treadmill may run most of the day under many different users. They cost
          several times what a good home treadmill costs, many makers only sell them through a quote,
          and the used market is large because gyms replace equipment on a schedule. This page puts
          dated, checked prices on the main brands and explains what moves the number up or down.
        </p>

